&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; padding-left: 18pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; padding-left: 18pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;Utility Plant accruals were immaterial in 2025 and in 2024.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;The total amount of AFUDC included in the Statement of Income was immaterial in 2025 and $0.2 million in 2024 (an equity &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;component&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; of $0.2 million and $0.0 interest expense &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;component&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;The composite weighted-average depreciation rates were 2.20% and 2.10% for the years ended December 31, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; and December 31, 2024, respectively. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; padding-left: 18pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;7.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Risk Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Credit Risk. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;Our&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; principal customers for natural gas transportation services are LNG providers, marketers, industrial &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;end-users&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; and utilities &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;located&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; Nova Sco&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;tia, New Brunswick,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; Maine,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;New Hampshire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; and Massachusetts. We have concentrations of receivables from these sectors throughout these Maritime provinces and states. These concentrations of customers may a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;ffect our o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;verall credit risk in that risk factors can negatively &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; the credit qu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;al&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;ity of the entire sector. Where exposed to credit risk, we analyze the customers&amp;#8217; financial condition prior to entering into an agreement, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;establish&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; credit limits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;moni&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;tor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; the appropr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;iatenes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;s of those limits on an ongoing basis. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;We also obtai&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;n parental guarantees, cash deposits, or letters of credit from customers to provide credit support, where &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;appropriate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;, based on our financial analysis of the customer and the regulatory or contractual terms and conditions applica&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;ble to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; each contract.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; padding-left: 18pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; padding-left: 18pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
