&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;Income taxes are &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;accrued&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;in accordance with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; the FERC Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowance &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;permitting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; the accrual of income taxes on a pass-through entity and the associated taxes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;accrued&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; are treated as &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;deemed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; contributions from the owners, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;whereas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; net operating loss carryovers are treated as &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;deemed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; distributions. The deemed contribution record&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;ed was &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;29.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; million in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; and $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;.9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; million in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; and are included within Other Paid in Capital in the Comparative Balance Sheet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;. We will make all necessary adjustments to account balances upon a ruling in Docket No. AC18-220-000. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;On December 22, 2017, the United States enacted the &amp;#8220;Tax Cuts and Jobs Act&amp;#8221; (&amp;#8220;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;TCJA &amp;#8221;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;). The changes in the TCJA are effective for taxation years beginning after December 31, 2017. While the changes are broad and complex, the most &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;significant change&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; is the reduction in the corporate federal income tax rate from 35% to 21%. We recorded a $78.4 million decrease to our 2017 deferred income tax liability, a $30.3 million increase to our 2017 deferred income tax &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;asset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; and an offsetting increase of $108.6 million to our regulatory liability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;In 2020, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;as a result of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; the settlement agreement that was reached in principle with shippers in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;December 2020, and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;subsequently&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; filed in Docket RP-20-921, we began amortizing the regulated liability &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;utilizing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; the reverse South Georgia flowback &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;methodology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; over the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;27.4 year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; remaining life of the assets. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;In &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;, we recorded a $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;3.7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; million decrease to regulatory liability, a $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;1.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; million decrease to our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; deferred income tax &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;asset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; and an offsetting $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;2.7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; million benefit to our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; deferred federal tax expense. In &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;, we recorded a $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;3.7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; million decrease to regulatory liability, a $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;1.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; million decrease to our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; deferr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;ed income tax &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;asset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; and an offsetting $2.7 million benefit to our 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt; deferred federal tax expense.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; padding-left: 18pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;9.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Related Party Transactions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; padding-left: 18pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;All related party transactions are provided in the normal course of business and, unless otherwise noted,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;are measured at the exchange amount, which is the amount of consideration &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;established&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; and agreed to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;by the related parties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;In the normal course of business, we provide natural gas transportation services to affiliates of the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;members. In addition, Enbridge and its affiliates provide management and operating services to us,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;pursuant to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; agreements &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;entered into&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; with us and, in some cases, our members. We reimburse them for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;the expenses incurred to provide these services, as well as for other expenses incurred on our behalf.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; background-color: #ffffff;"&gt;Our transactions with related parties are as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table style="width: 100%; margin-left: 1pt; border-collapse: collapse;" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 1%; padding: 1pt; vertical-align: middle;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 68.54%; padding: 1pt; vertical-align: middle;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 0.1%; padding: 1pt; vertical-align: middle;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 1%; padding: 1pt; vertical-align: middle;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 13.78%; padding: 1pt; vertical-align: middle;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 0.1%; padding: 1pt; vertical-align: middle;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
