&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 13.5pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -13.5pt; padding-left: 13pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-style: italic;"&gt;(a)In the normal course of business, we provide natural gas transportation and other services to our affiliates Mobil Natural Gas, Inc. and Emera Inc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 13.5pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -13.5pt; padding-left: 13pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-style: italic;"&gt;(b)M&amp;amp;N Management Company, LLC and M&amp;amp;N Operating Company, affiliates of SEP (collectively, M&amp;amp;N), provide management and operating services for us, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-style: italic;"&gt;pursuant to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-style: italic;"&gt; agreements &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-style: italic;"&gt;entered into&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-style: italic;"&gt; with us, and in some cases, our members. M&amp;amp;N incurs costs on our behalf and is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-style: italic;"&gt;subsequently&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-style: italic;"&gt; reimbursed by us. These expenses are included in Operating Expenses in the Statement of Income. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 13.5pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -13.5pt; padding-left: 13pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Aptos Display'; font-style: italic;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
