    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHFBDD85F7F90B25C7A304AB35C1BD3DEA" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <span style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;">All system balancing gas recorded under the fixed asset method as defined by FERC Order 581.</span>
          <br style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;" />
          <span style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;">System gas volumes needed for load balancing, no notice transportation and other operational purposes is recorded in account 117.2 (current portion). For purposes of accounting for encroachment resulting from line inventory changes, we used Account 117.4 with appropriate debits to Account 808.1 and credits to Account 808.2.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH872D2E59D2E5C7F1F4EFCDBAA5F9A997" xlink:to="HHFBDD85F7F90B25C7A304AB35C1BD3DEA" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHAAFA1517026EB96D34A209A12BC03AC9" xlink:label="HHAAFA1517026EB96D34A209A12BC03AC9" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH35D4A7C92E49F19CC03524846FD5E5C0" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <div>
          <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">Recorded pursuant to 18 CFR 154.402(a) and 18 CFR 382.202.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHAAFA1517026EB96D34A209A12BC03AC9" xlink:to="HH35D4A7C92E49F19CC03524846FD5E5C0" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH423EDA05AA7D4C648FBC2FF8CED9181F" xlink:label="HH423EDA05AA7D4C648FBC2FF8CED9181F" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH24681527AE36EB798282F3F73CF17161" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <div>
          <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">Balance relates to a regulatory asset created as a result of the difference between GAAP and FERC depreciation (Levelized depreciation) created in the years that the FERC rate was less than straight-line rate (prior to 2003). 
          <br /><br />Per FERC Docket (RP02-134-000): The commission approved, by order dated 4/14/1999, M&amp;N's proposal to use the modified depreciation expense approach to achieve a levelized cost-of-serviceover the first four years of service on M&amp;N's facilities. The depreciation rate change relates to main pipeline except laterals, intangibles and general plant. In that order, the Commission directed that M&amp;N record the regulatory asset created by the difference in the depreciation expense between the modified depreciation rate and the straight-line book depreciation rate in account 182.3. Accordingly, the March 12, 2003 Order in Docket No. RP02-134-000 approves the un-amortized regulatory asset remaining after this levelization period shall continue to be depreciated.
        </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH423EDA05AA7D4C648FBC2FF8CED9181F" xlink:to="HH24681527AE36EB798282F3F73CF17161" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH92B61E2EC5B5A8F6AD9B15DEB5DB16F0" xlink:label="HH92B61E2EC5B5A8F6AD9B15DEB5DB16F0" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHA940625FA64FB244FAA7170AAA5EC895" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <div>
          <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">Docket No. AI93-5-001 issued on April 23, 1993 (Accounting for Income Taxes).</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH92B61E2EC5B5A8F6AD9B15DEB5DB16F0" xlink:to="HHA940625FA64FB244FAA7170AAA5EC895" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH304CCECDD2F4C9D9648D5107B2AB3B21" xlink:label="HH304CCECDD2F4C9D9648D5107B2AB3B21" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH2575052A023076EA1839A53E430B3FED" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
