          <span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;">The reported rate of return was included in a black box settlement in Docket No. RP 24-780.</span>
        </div>
        <div style="color: #000000; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium;">
          <span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;">a. Return on Equity for Future Projects: 13.5% (Will be used to calculate AFUDC and used in preparation of initial rates in a certificate proceeding.)</span>
