    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHAC63CC9A4C95A782B4FC7F5DE7DEB371" xlink:label="HHAC63CC9A4C95A782B4FC7F5DE7DEB371" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH7B6A8AB539293C7DA8E60A5F89D3B564" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Per FERC Docket (CP96-178-000), represents costs incurred on a portion of the M&amp;N Phase I facilities which were placed into service on March 10, 1999. This regulatory asset arises from the deferral of operating costs incurred on the 83 miles of Phase I joint facilities with Portland Natural Gas Transmission System (PNGTS). The FERC allowed M&amp;N to defer the costs beginning from 12/1/99. The asset is being amortized at a rate of 2.15% over the life of the facilities.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHAC63CC9A4C95A782B4FC7F5DE7DEB371" xlink:to="HH7B6A8AB539293C7DA8E60A5F89D3B564" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHE0CC184C053E20DE1889FE860CF28229" xlink:label="HHE0CC184C053E20DE1889FE860CF28229" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH6B81BF5F5DBAE6C5CD63EAAB9D386339" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;" border="1">
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 49.9315%;">Meals &amp; Entertainment</td>
              <td style="width: 49.9315%;">54,460</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 49.9315%;">Dues</td>
              <td style="width: 49.9315%;">7,365</td>
